From 9def3de0beb68e5adb86264cc71cb08c1160a90f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:32:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 22/29] mobileshell: Android-like task switcher over wayfire
 IPC

Cards of the app windows, newest first, scrolled sideways. Tap goes back
to the app (also restores it when minimized), swipe up closes it, with
SIGTERM when the window is still there 1.5 s later. Replaces the wayfire
scale plugin, whose GLES renderer crashes when a window closes under it.
Opened by D-Bus pl.s10plus.ScreenGrab.toggleTaskSwitcher.

Signed-off-by: Artur <ganggg111@gmail.com>
